    </rdf:Seq>
   </dc:creator>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Police line up above 'All Cops Are Bastards' graffiti at the Intercontinental Semiramis Hotel along the Nile River. Tension between protestors and riot police continued for the fifth day after Egypt's second anniversary of the Revolution.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
